<title>MALAYSIA: Rashid takes Konsortium stake.</title>
<headline>Rashid takes Konsortium stake.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1997-01-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>The securities arm of Rashid Hussain Bhd has agreed to take up to 9.1 percent stake in hauliers Konsortium Perkapalan Bhd following a placement agreement between the two companies.</p>
<p>The national Bernama news agency reported a Konsortium statement on Wednesday as saying that Rashid Hussain Securities Sdn Bhd has agreed to subscribe or buy up to 16.1 million new Konsortium shares at 16.0 ringgit each.</p>
<p>The new shares are part of a private share placement in which Rashid Hussain Securities is the placement agent.</p>
<p>The issue price represents a discount to Konsortium's last traded price of 16.40 ringgit on Tuesday.</p>
<p>Konsortium stock closed at 16.20 on Wednesday.</p>
</text>
